data: {"id": "95d2a111537c4dba-thinking-parallel_evidence-1281", "run_id": "95d2a111537c4dba", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已采集的真实工具结果，对候选原因\"启动命令错误或权限不足\"进行评估：\n\n### 支持事实\n- **事件证据**：kubectl_events 显示 `Back-off restarting failed container app`，377 次重启，退出码 **exitCode=78**。\n- **容器状态**：kubectl_get_yaml 确认 `reason=CrashLoopBackOff`，容器未就绪（`Ready: status=False`）。\n- **关键日志**：kubectl_previous_logs 日志显示应用启动后立即返回 **`{\"event\":\"http_request\",\"message\":\"CONFIG_MISSING\",\"http_status\":500}`**。这表明容器已正常启动（Python 解释器正确找到了 `server.py` 并执行了），但在应用层缺失了关键配置。\n\n### 冲突与反驳\n- **反驳“命令错误”**：命令格式 `command: python3 /opt/aiops/server.py` 已成功执行（否则日志里会", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788797320002, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

